+| nearest defender | n | believed P | real completion |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| trailing, < 1.5 yd | 61 | 0.46 | 0.43 |
+| trailing, 1.5-3 yd | 46 | 0.53 | 0.48 |
+| facing him, < 1.5 yd | 36 | 0.54 | 0.50 |
+| facing him, 1.5-3 yd | 105 | 0.61 | 0.67 |
+| facing him, 5+ yd | 71 | 0.56 | 0.79 |
